      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 38 Solution: AI Agents with Tools\n\nA real n8n **AI Agent** node with an OpenAI Chat Model, Simple Memory and two tools: **Wikipedia Search** (HTTP Request Tool — the agent fills in the search term itself via `$fromAI`) and **Word Counter** (Code Tool). The agent decides which tool to call; open the AI Agent node's output after a run to see each tool call in order.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** OpenAI API key, set on the OpenAI Chat Model node. (Wikipedia's API is public, no credential needed.)\n\n**Test:** `curl -X POST <test-url> -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"request\": \"How many words are in the phrase artificial intelligence agents automate research, and what is n8n?\"}'`\n\n**Reference:** WEEK_06_AI_AGENTS/DAILY_TASKS/DAY_38_AI_Agents_with_Tools.md",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 440
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-agent-trigger",
      "name": "AI Agent Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ai-agent",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "prepare-request",
      "name": "Prepare Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "user_request",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.request }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "session_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.session_id || 'default-session' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "research-agent",
      "name": "Research Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        740,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.user_request }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a research assistant. Use the Wikipedia Search tool to look up unfamiliar topics before answering, and use the Word Counter tool if the user asks about text length. Always explain which tools you used."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-chat-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        560,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "simple-memory",
      "name": "Simple Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        720,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $json.session_id }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wikipedia-search",
      "name": "Wikipedia Search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequestTool",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "action",
              "value": "query"
            },
            {
              "name": "list",
              "value": "search"
            },
            {
              "name": "srsearch",
              "value": "={{ $fromAI('search_term', 'The topic to look up on Wikipedia, in a few words', 'string') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "format",
              "value": "json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "toolDescription": "Searches Wikipedia for background information on a topic."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "word-counter",
      "name": "Word Counter",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolCode",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1040,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "description": "Counts words in a block of text. Pass the exact text to count.",
        "jsCode": "// The agent's input arrives in `query`; a Code Tool must return a string.\nconst words = String(query).trim().split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean);\nreturn String(words.length);"
      }
    }
  ],
